  "scope": "coeff=(k>=0 and k<=n)?combinations(n,k)*a^(n-k):0; bar0=(0<=n)?combinations(n,0)*a^n:0; bar1=(1<=n)?combinations(n,1)*a^(n-1):0; bar2=(2<=n)?combinations(n,2)*a^(n-2):0; bar3=(3<=n)?combinations(n,3)*a^(n-3):0; bar4=(4<=n)?combinations(n,4)*a^(n-4):0; bar5=(5<=n)?combinations(n,5)*a^(n-5):0; bar6=(6<=n)?combinations(n,6)*a^(n-6):0; bar7=(7<=n)?combinations(n,7)*a^(n-7):0; bar8=(8<=n)?combinations(n,8)*a^(n-8):0; bar9=(9<=n)?combinations(n,9)*a^(n-9):0; bar10=(10<=n)?combinations(n,10)*a^(n-10):0; yMax=(abs(a)+1)^n; yMin=min(0,bar0,bar1,bar2,bar3,bar4,bar5,bar6,bar7,bar8,bar9,bar10); sumBars=bar0+bar1+bar2+bar3+bar4+bar5+bar6+bar7+bar8+bar9+bar10; barK=(k>=0 and k<=n)?combinations(n,k)*a^(n-k):0;",
